Z||000010||MinnGreenGT||07-30-2001||05:33 PM||||Hey guys... haven't actually run into many Minnesota people here yet.  Why are people going to Duluth?  Do you guys realize that about 10 Minnesota Fieros (myself included) went on a Duluth Cruise the last time you met at Calhoun...? Is there some sort of "anti-club" thing happening here? ...Not that I'm some sort of MFF-Only purist or anything-just wondering?  I've seen people with signatures showing "Minnesota Sport Compact Fieros"?  Anyway- if you're doing it on the 11th I might be in town- I'd love to show up and just hang out for awhile... then maybe cruise over to University!  Keep posting!<P>Later-<BR>Rob Bartlett<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grngt.jpg">  <BR><p>[This message has been edited by MinnGreenGT (edited 07-30-2001).]||||reg||1
