Z||000013||fierohoho||07-30-2001||08:42 PM||||MinnGreenGT, we're not going to Duluth on the 11th. <P>No, we're not an anti-club group, I am a MFF member myself.<P>The reason we met last time while the MFF club went to Duluth was because some of us didn't have the whole weekend off. <P>You should come down and meet up with us on the 11th, we had a good time last time.<P>Maybe in the future we could have a meet in say Hinckley or Pine City on I35 so the Duluth guys could meet us half way, any thoughts on that?<P>I think those who made the last Calhoun meet would welcome any MFF members who are free that evening, as for where we go after we leave Calhoun we'll decide that then.<P>Hope to see lots of Fiereo lovers there.<P>------------------<BR>'84 SE 2.5l<BR>'85 Coupe 2.5l now getting a 3800<BR>'86 SE 2.5l||||reg||1
