Z||000018||Standard||07-31-2001||12:21 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by JSocha:<BR><B>Don't know which route your are taking, but if you are taking Highway 2 from Grand Forks, Devils Lake, "Rugby" to Minot, if you have some time, would you be interested in swinging on over for a beer or two so I can meet another forum member in person?<P>We are just on the EAST side of Rugby, big house (mansion) on the right hand (North) side next to and right before the golf course (when heading West).<P>Also, V8Fiero lives in Minot.<P>Let me know if you are interested.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I don't know which way we'll be going, and we'll probably be headed up there thursday.  Honestly, I don't think my friend would be too up for it.  He likes Fiero's (I got him into 'em) but I know he'd be insanely bored listening to us ramble  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <P>I would like to head out there sometime later in august or september, though.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000019||JSocha||07-31-2001||12:29 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Standard:<BR><B>I would like to head out there sometime later in august or september, though.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Door is always open.  Just contact me here or via email (whatever).  But if you do and you do pass our house...tap your friend, point to the house and tell him you know who lives there.  When he is in disbelief, make him drive up the long drive way (with the Private Drive sign), ring the door bell and introduce yourself.  Watch him sh*t his drawers.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>BTW, who was going to ramble.  Just drink a beer or two and give your legs a stretch before you continue!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||1
