Z||000021||JSocha||07-31-2001||09:30 AM||||Yep!  Will be right on your "right hand side" just as you are about ready to enter Rugby.  You will pass the Geographical Center 5 Mile sign, go over a hill and see the lights and/or Rugby dead ahead.  You can't miss it as it is typically field field to your right, then water, then this huge house (and when I say huge, you will think it is the Golf Course Club house) on a hill.  There will be a power station (which is in the process of going up) and a red horse barn (and horses) on your left hand side almost right across the highway from the house.  There is also a small shed and a blue house just west of the red barn (neighbors).<P>Then past our house (still on the right), immidately starts the Rugby Golf Course.  There is a driveway just on the east side with an off white two rail fence all the way up with a mailbox at the highway.<P>Trust me when I say, you can't miss it as it is the only large house on a hill with brick retaining walls.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||1
